{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Group20 exact merged-SHA independent review receipt, part 2/3 (58 rows). Nonauthor agent /root/resume_group04 reviewed all 172 Optometric blocks; 36 grouped path blobs are byte-identical between candidate b433eca691ea2df30d1827493916de5a13caea0a and merged Gerrit 3092 c1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135. Every row has strict shrink and directive/semantic/bloat PASS. Full TSV SHA-256 693303f91ff6b98a0641b427d8c7a71ec4fd190cd6cbc864637b8c8b429ef566; this chunk SHA-256 f44100ce8d6415b52a608257b9048fc38ac02d0df29396da62124371e6969452.\n\n```tsv\nstable_block_id\tbefore_citation\tfinal_citation\tpreserved_contract_or_consumer\tdirectives_exact\tbefore_words\tafter_words\tsemantic-preservation\tbloat-removal\treviewer_session\n\"src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_apply_phases.py#C:_confirm_link_add:before:link_id = result.get(\"\"id\"\") if isinstance(result, dict) else None:1\"\t\"b10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_apply_phases.py#C:_confirm_link_add:before:link_id = result.get(\"\"id\"\") if isinstance(result, dict) else None:1\"\t\"c1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_apply_phases.py#C:_confirm_link_add:before:link_id = result.get(\"\"id\"\") if isinstance(result, dict) else None:1\"\t# Record the vendor link ID when supplied. A missing ID is valid evidence.\tPASS\t34\t13\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_apply_phases.py#D:_update_one_dispatch_links\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_apply_phases.py#D:_update_one_dispatch_links\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_apply_phases.py#D:_update_one_dispatch_links\tDispatch deduplicated link adds and managed removals. Return computed, applied, and failed counts after add deduplication. A landed add may call link_confirm with peer evidence. Link failures are reported without unwinding successful scalar updates.\tPASS\t190\t34\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\n\"src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_apply_phases.py#C:_update_one_dispatch_links:before:links = mutation.get(\"\"links\"\", []) or []:1\"\t\"b10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_apply_phases.py#C:_update_one_dispatch_links:before:links = mutation.get(\"\"links\"\", []) or []:1\"\t\"c1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_apply_phases.py#C:_update_one_dispatch_links:before:links = mutation.get(\"\"links\"\", []) or []:1\"\t# Probe existing links once before adding. Either direction counts as present. # A timed-out but committed prior write must not create a duplicate.\tPASS\t83\t22\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_apply_phases.py#C:_update_one_dispatch_links:before:if (:1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_apply_phases.py#C:_update_one_dispatch_links:before:if (:1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_apply_phases.py#C:_update_one_dispatch_links:before:if (:1\t# Check link capability before counting an add. A designed skip must not appear # as a silent-no-op failure.\tPASS\t83\t17\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#D:<module>\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#D:<module>\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#D:<module>\tPer-ticket outbound dispatch: create_one / update_one, one attempt per Jira call. Each Jira call is a single attempt. Transports own retries. create_one guards the call budget, deduplicates by identity label, and delegates the write-ahead create route. update_one sequences parent, scalar, label, comment, and link sub-operations. batch_dispatch re-exports these entry points and error types.\tPASS\t153\t52\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#C:<module>:before:_find_link_id,  # noqa: F401 — re-export for batch_dispatch:1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#C:<module>:before:_find_link_id,  # noqa: F401 — re-export for batch_dispatch:1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#C:<module>:before:_find_link_id,  # noqa: F401 — re-export for batch_dispatch:1\t# Keep these link-probe exports for batch_dispatch and its callers.\tPASS\t37\t9\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#D:create_one\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#D:create_one\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#D:create_one\tCreate one Jira issue within the REST budget, or defer it without a call. A keyless pending binding within index-lag grace also defers. Search the rebar-id label first and confirm an existing issue instead of creating a duplicate. Otherwise translate bridge fields, run one selected write-ahead core, then send user labels and comments. Return the create result, dedup sentinel, or None when deferred.\tPASS\t220\t63\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#C:create_one:before:if jira_key::1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#C:create_one:before:if jira_key::1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#C:create_one:before:if jira_key::1\t# After identity is durable, send user labels and comments. Their failures are # reported without rolling back the created issue.\tPASS\t85\t19\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#C:create_one:before:if (:1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#C:create_one:before:if (:1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#C:create_one:before:if (:1\t# Check comment capability once when comments exist. A designed skip leaves # comment_errors for failed calls while the create remains successful.\tPASS\t87\t20\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\n\"src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#C:create_one:before:body = entry.get(\"\"wire_body\"\") or entry.get(\"\"body\"\", \"\"\"\"):1\"\t\"b10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#C:create_one:before:body = entry.get(\"\"wire_body\"\") or entry.get(\"\"body\"\", \"\"\"\"):1\"\t\"c1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#C:create_one:before:body = entry.get(\"\"wire_body\"\") or entry.get(\"\"body\"\", \"\"\"\"):1\"\t# Send the wire body used for deduplication. Older entries fall back to body.\tPASS\t39\t13\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\n\"src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#C:create_one:before:_comment_result = cast(\"\"SupportsComments\"\", client).add_comment(jira_key, body):1\"\t\"b10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#C:create_one:before:_comment_result = cast(\"\"SupportsComments\"\", client).add_comment(jira_key, body):1\"\t\"c1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#C:create_one:before:_comment_result = cast(\"\"SupportsComments\"\", client).add_comment(jira_key, body):1\"\t# Post comments once because retrying without a Jira idempotency key can # duplicate them. The next pass handles a failed post.\tPASS\t36\t20\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#C:create_one:before:_record_comment_id(binding_store, entry, _comment_result):1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#C:create_one:before:_record_comment_id(binding_store, entry, _comment_result):1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#C:create_one:before:_record_comment_id(binding_store, entry, _comment_result):1\t# Record local comment identity after a landed post to prevent replay.\tPASS\t26\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#C:create_one:before:if comment_errors is not None::1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#C:create_one:before:if comment_errors is not None::1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#C:create_one:before:if comment_errors is not None::1\t# Keep a nonfatal comment failure visible in the batch outcome.\tPASS\t25\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#D:_emit_create_identity_alert\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#D:_emit_create_identity_alert\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#D:_emit_create_identity_alert\tRecord an identity-write failure after Jira create without deleting the issue. The keyed pending binding supports deterministic recovery. Alert-write failure must not mask the original error.\tPASS\t85\t26\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#D:update_one\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#D:update_one\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#D:update_one\tUpdate an issue through parent, scalar, label, comment, and link phases. Comment and link failures are nonfatal but reach their error sinks and sub-operation counts. These counts distinguish a designed capability skip from a silent no-op. The scalar phase returns only fields whose Jira edit completed for baseline merge.\tPASS\t261\t49\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\n\"src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#C:_update_one_apply_parent:before:_has_parent_op = \"\"parent\"\" in fields:1\"\t\"b10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#C:_update_one_apply_parent:before:_has_parent_op = \"\"parent\"\" in fields:1\"\t\"c1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#C:_update_one_apply_parent:before:_has_parent_op = \"\"parent\"\" in fields:1\"\t# A present parent key may request SET or CLEAR. Remove it before the scalar # allowlist and use set_parent for both values. Absence means no parent operation.\tPASS\t208\t26\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#C:_update_one_apply_parent:before:if exc.code == 400::1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#C:_update_one_apply_parent:before:if exc.code == 400::1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#C:_update_one_apply_parent:before:if exc.code == 400::1\t# Treat HTTP 400 as a hierarchy rejection. Continue the batch, but record the # parent divergence in bridge alerts. Other parent failures remain visible too.\tPASS\t123\t24\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#D:_update_one_scalar_update\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#D:_update_one_scalar_update\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/dispatch_one.py#D:_update_one_scalar_update\tRun the scalar edit and handle an illegal-transition 400 with its comment fallback. Forward assignee_is_account_id only for a resolved account ID. Return the edit result and applied fields, keeping applied fields empty if the edit failed.\tPASS\t71\t36\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/fetch_paging.py#D:<module>\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/fetch_paging.py#D:<module>\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/fetch_paging.py#D:<module>\tDrain paged Jira searches while detecting silent truncation. The helpers enforce a per-query ceiling and detect repeated cursor tokens or offsets. fetcher re-exports these names for its callers.\tPASS\t61\t28\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/fetch_paging.py#C:<module>:before:_ACLI_CEILING = 1200:1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/fetch_paging.py#C:<module>:before:_ACLI_CEILING = 1200:1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/fetch_paging.py#C:<module>:before:_ACLI_CEILING = 1200:1\t# Refuse a query at the 1200-issue ACLI ceiling rather than return a partial set.\tPASS\t65\t14\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/fetch_paging.py#D:SilentTruncationError\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/fetch_paging.py#D:SilentTruncationError\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/fetch_paging.py#D:SilentTruncationError\tRaise when the 1200-issue ceiling or a cursor or offset stall would return a partial search result.\tPASS\t31\t17\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/fetch_paging.py#D:_iter_pages\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/fetch_paging.py#D:_iter_pages\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/fetch_paging.py#D:_iter_pages\tYield search pages until an empty page, an explicit cap, or a proven short-page repeat. A short page alone does not prove exhaustion because Jira may cap its returned page size. Advance by returned length. Raise SilentTruncationError before yielding a page that reaches the ACLI ceiling, repeats a cursor token, or repeats a full page at a new offset. A caller cap clips the final page without error.\tPASS\t146\t68\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\n\"src/rebar/reconciler/fetch_paging.py#C:_iter_pages:before:first_key = page[0].get(\"\"key\"\") if isinstance(page[0], dict) else None:1\"\t\"b10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/fetch_paging.py#C:_iter_pages:before:first_key = page[0].get(\"\"key\"\") if isinstance(page[0], dict) else None:1\"\t\"c1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/fetch_paging.py#C:_iter_pages:before:first_key = page[0].get(\"\"key\"\") if isinstance(page[0], dict) else None:1\"\t# Check the first key before yielding to avoid duplicate rows. A repeated full # page proves an offset stall and raises. A repeated short page ends a client # that ignores offsets after all available rows have been yielded.\tPASS\t182\t37\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/fetch_paging.py#C:_iter_pages:before:start_at += len(page):1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/fetch_paging.py#C:_iter_pages:before:start_at += len(page):1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/fetch_paging.py#C:_iter_pages:before:start_at += len(page):1\t# Advance by returned length until an empty page. A short page can reflect a # server cap rather than the end of the result set.\tPASS\t143\t24\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:<module>:before:from rebar.config import reconciler_repo_root:1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:<module>:before:from rebar.config import reconciler_repo_root:1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:<module>:before:from rebar.config import reconciler_repo_root:1\t# Absolute imports support standalone by-path loading.\tPASS\t9\t6\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\n\"src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:<module>:before:_PROJECT_KEY_RE = re.compile(r\"\"^[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9_]*$\"\"):1\"\t\"b10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:<module>:before:_PROJECT_KEY_RE = re.compile(r\"\"^[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9_]*$\"\"):1\"\t\"c1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:<module>:before:_PROJECT_KEY_RE = re.compile(r\"\"^[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9_]*$\"\"):1\"\t# Split active and recent-Done queries under the configured project key. # Cap Done at 1000 by updated time. Older Done issues remain outside the fetch # window. Validate the project key before constructing either scoped JQL query.\tPASS\t218\t35\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:<module>:before:_DONE_RECENT_CAP = 1000:1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:<module>:before:_DONE_RECENT_CAP = 1000:1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:<module>:before:_DONE_RECENT_CAP = 1000:1\t# The Done query sorts by update time before this client-side cap.\tPASS\t39\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#D:_load_acli\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#D:_load_acli\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#D:_load_acli\tLazily select the configured backend transport to avoid import cycles and retain standalone by-path loading.\tPASS\t33\t15\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\n\"src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:<module>:before:_ALERT_STORE_KEY = \"\"rebar.reconciler.alert_store\"\":1\"\t\"b10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:<module>:before:_ALERT_STORE_KEY = \"\"rebar.reconciler.alert_store\"\":1\"\t\"c1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:<module>:before:_ALERT_STORE_KEY = \"\"rebar.reconciler.alert_store\"\":1\"\t# Register alert_store under its canonical dotted key so production loads and # test patches share one module object.\tPASS\t69\t17\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#D:merge_parent_map\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#D:merge_parent_map\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#D:merge_parent_map\tMerge observed parents while preserving 3 states. A missing map key means the issue was not observed and leaves parent absent. A nonempty value writes its parent key. An explicit None records an authoritative parent clear. The inbound differ must never infer a destructive clear from missing enrichment.\tPASS\t284\t48\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#D:merge_issuelinks_map\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#D:merge_issuelinks_map\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#D:merge_issuelinks_map\tMerge observed Jira links by key presence. A missing key leaves issuelinks unobserved, while an explicit empty list proves no links and may support a managed removal. Failed or skipped enrichment cannot imply a removal.\tPASS\t227\t35\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_enrich_parents:before:if exc.code == 410::1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_enrich_parents:before:if exc.code == 410::1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_enrich_parents:before:if exc.code == 410::1\t# Report retired API routes loudly. Other HTTP faults remain warnings.\tPASS\t34\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_enrich_parents:before:raise:1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_enrich_parents:before:raise:1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_enrich_parents:before:raise:1\t# A stalled whole-project parent read must not masquerade as an authoritative # empty map.\tPASS\t22\t13\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#D:_enrich_comments\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#D:_enrich_comments\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#D:_enrich_comments\tEnrich one project in place. Pager stalls raise. Other faults defer.\tPASS\t14\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_enrich_comments:before:try::1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_enrich_comments:before:try::1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_enrich_comments:before:try::1\t# Use one paged comment-map read per project. Only returned comment fields # become observed. Others retain the per-ticket fallback.\tPASS\t64\t18\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_enrich_comments:before:raise:1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_enrich_comments:before:raise:1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_enrich_comments:before:raise:1\t# A stalled comment-map read cannot supply an authoritative project view.\tPASS\t11\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#D:_enrich_issuelinks\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#D:_enrich_issuelinks\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#D:_enrich_issuelinks\tEnrich one project in place. Pager stalls raise. Other faults defer.\tPASS\t16\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_enrich_issuelinks:before:try::1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_enrich_issuelinks:before:try::1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_enrich_issuelinks:before:try::1\t# Read issue links in one paged project call because base search omits them. # Merge only returned lists. Failed enrichment remains unobserved and cannot # justify an inbound removal.\tPASS\t69\t27\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#D:_enrich_project\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#D:_enrich_project\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#D:_enrich_project\tRun parent, comment, and link enrichment for one project. Each fails open independently, while a pagination stall raises. Mutate and return the shared snapshot.\tPASS\t74\t24\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#D:_fetch_project\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#D:_fetch_project\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#D:_fetch_project\tDrain active and recent-Done queries into one ordered project result. The caller merges only a complete result, so mid-page failure contributes no partial keys. Invalid project keys and truncation still fail closed.\tPASS\t61\t32\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_build_snapshot:before:from rebar.config import compose_config:1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_build_snapshot:before:from rebar.config import compose_config:1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_build_snapshot:before:from rebar.config import compose_config:1\t# Use the backend's configured query_project without a fallback. An absent or # invalid project must fail closed before JQL search.\tPASS\t44\t19\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_build_snapshot:before:from rebar.reconciler import projects_store:1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_build_snapshot:before:from rebar.reconciler import projects_store:1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_build_snapshot:before:from rebar.reconciler import projects_store:1\t# projects.json selects synced projects. An unseeded store uses the configured # query project. Malformed mappings fail closed.\tPASS\t27\t17\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_build_snapshot:before:alert_store = _load_alert_store():1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_build_snapshot:before:alert_store = _load_alert_store():1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_build_snapshot:before:alert_store = _load_alert_store():1\t# Load alert_store only after module initialization to avoid a cycle.\tPASS\t12\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_build_snapshot:before:_isolate_projects = len(project_list) > 1:1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_build_snapshot:before:_isolate_projects = len(project_list) > 1:1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_build_snapshot:before:_isolate_projects = len(project_list) > 1:1\t# Build scoped JQL before project isolation. A transport failure drops only its # project without merging partial keys when other projects remain. A single-project # failure and any truncation still fail closed.\tPASS\t92\t30\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_build_snapshot:before:for _proj in project_list::1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_build_snapshot:before:for _proj in project_list::1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/fetcher.py#C:_build_snapshot:before:for _proj in project_list::1\t# Enrich each mapped project separately. Ordinary enrichment faults stay local. # A pagination stall raises.\tPASS\t31\t14\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/impossible_links.py#D:<module>\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/impossible_links.py#D:<module>\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/impossible_links.py#D:<module>\tRemember inbound links whose local graph cannot accept them yet. Classify only closed-source, redundant-ancestry, and cycle errors as structural. Unknown errors remain retryable. ImpossibleLinkStore keys each record by source, target, and relation with a deciding structural digest. Endpoint chains suffice for closed or redundant links. Cycles need the whole dependency graph. A changed digest retries the link. Unreadable state or an unavailable digest also retries. The separate file avoids changing binding-store schema.\tPASS\t424\t72\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/impossible_links.py#C:<module>:before:_SIGNATURES: tuple[tuple[str, tuple[str, ...]], ...] = (:1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/impossible_links.py#C:<module>:before:_SIGNATURES: tuple[tuple[str, tuple[str, ...]], ...] = (:1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/impossible_links.py#C:<module>:before:_SIGNATURES: tuple[tuple[str, tuple[str, ...]], ...] = (:1\t# Require every substring of a known graph error before recording a permanent # structural reason. A partial match must remain retryable.\tPASS\t88\t20\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/impossible_links.py#D:_endpoint_fingerprint\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/impossible_links.py#D:_endpoint_fingerprint\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/impossible_links.py#D:_endpoint_fingerprint\tHash each endpoint and ancestor status, parent, and dependency set. Hierarchy promotion may move the deciding status to an ancestor. Exclude nonstructural prose and tags so unrelated edits do not reattempt a link.\tPASS\t131\t33\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/impossible_links.py#D:_global_structure_fingerprint\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/impossible_links.py#D:_global_structure_fingerprint\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/impossible_links.py#D:_global_structure_fingerprint\tHash graph status, parent, and dependencies for cycle verdicts. A change to an intermediate ticket can break a cycle without changing either endpoint. Extra retries after structural changes are safer than suppressing a valid link.\tPASS\t119\t35\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/inbound_collection_diffs.py#D:<module>\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/inbound_collection_diffs.py#D:<module>\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/inbound_collection_diffs.py#D:<module>\tPure inbound differences for comments, labels, and links on bound tickets. Each helper returns mutation records for compute_inbound_mutations. The scalar field differ remains in inbound_differ, which re-exports these helpers.\tPASS\t146\t29\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/inbound_collection_diffs.py#C:<module>:before:_EXCLUDED_PREFIXES: tuple[str, ...] = (:1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/inbound_collection_diffs.py#C:<module>:before:_EXCLUDED_PREFIXES: tuple[str, ...] = (:1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/inbound_collection_diffs.py#C:<module>:before:_EXCLUDED_PREFIXES: tuple[str, ...] = (:1\t# Exclude canonical and legacy rebar-id labels plus status annotations from # local tags. They are bridge-owned identity and status metadata.\tPASS\t134\t19\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/inbound_collection_diffs.py#D:_diff_comments_inbound\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/inbound_collection_diffs.py#D:_diff_comments_inbound\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/inbound_collection_diffs.py#D:_diff_comments_inbound\tRead Jira comments from the singular comment.comments snapshot field. Absent or malformed comment data emits nothing. Skip bridge-marked echoes and IDs already present locally. Emit each remaining plain-text add with its Jira comment ID for local persistence.\tPASS\t183\t38\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/inbound_collection_diffs.py#C:<module>:before:def _diff_links_inbound(:1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/inbound_collection_diffs.py#C:<module>:before:def _diff_links_inbound(:1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/inbound_collection_diffs.py#C:<module>:before:def _diff_links_inbound(:1\t# Load shared link-direction rules for inbound adds and outbound removals. # The loader keeps standalone module imports working.\tPASS\t48\t17\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/inbound_collection_diffs.py#D:_diff_links_inbound\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/inbound_collection_diffs.py#D:_diff_links_inbound\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/inbound_collection_diffs.py#D:_diff_links_inbound\tAdd Jira links using shared direction rules. Skip an edge already stored on this ticket or as the inverse on its active counterpart. A missing active counterpart cannot prove deduplication, so do not emit its mirror.\tPASS\t128\t36\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/inbound_collection_diffs.py#D:_diff_link_removals_inbound\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/inbound_collection_diffs.py#D:_diff_link_removals_inbound\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/inbound_collection_diffs.py#D:_diff_link_removals_inbound\tRemove a local managed link only after Jira link enrichment was observed for this issue, even when the observed list is empty. Require a bound target and should_propagate_removal before emitting a local-relation removal. Missing or malformed issuelinks data cannot prove deletion. Unlike add deduplication, archived counterparts do not suppress a confirmed removal.\tPASS\t301\t52\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/inbound_differ.py#D:<module>\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/inbound_differ.py#D:<module>\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/inbound_differ.py#D:<module>\tCompare Jira snapshots with bound local tickets and emit inbound mutations. Local changes win same-pass conflicts. Unbound Jira issues are skipped for outbound creation. This differ uses the binding interface and injected backend mappers.\tPASS\t112\t34\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/inbound_differ.py#C:<module>:before:from rebar.reconciler.inbound_collection_diffs import (  # noqa: F401:1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/inbound_differ.py#C:<module>:before:from rebar.reconciler.inbound_collection_diffs import (  # noqa: F401:1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/inbound_differ.py#C:<module>:before:from rebar.reconciler.inbound_collection_diffs import (  # noqa: F401:1\t# Re-export collection differs for existing module attributes and local calls.\tPASS\t61\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\nsrc/rebar/reconciler/inbound_differ.py#C:<module>:before:from rebar.reconciler.inbound_fields import (  # noqa: F401:1\tb10a2309d65b4128c30dd7839a6d9905b8158e63:src/rebar/reconciler/inbound_differ.py#C:<module>:before:from rebar.reconciler.inbound_fields import (  # noqa: F401:1\tc1ec32a1996bdda0ed287c44ef8a1c9ea1b57135:src/rebar/reconciler/inbound_differ.py#C:<module>:before:from rebar.reconciler.inbound_fields import (  # noqa: F401:1\t# Re-export field helpers for existing callers and config parity tests. # The vendor mapper comes through the injected Backend port.\tPASS\t95\t19\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\n```"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1792814463489482693,"uuid":"445436d5-9b98-4566-a028-cc5ffeb9044a"}